 new \u201clegend\u201d with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras/6802b93068ac47f1ff1c7305b11bf4cc.avif?t=1772290875\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras_big/6802b93068ac47f1ff1c7305b11bf4cc.avif?t=1772290875 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras/8ff116297f9c0cdc41f2d3187234a61c.avif?t=1772290875\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras_big/8ff116297f9c0cdc41f2d3187234a61c.avif?t=1772290875 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras/b482834a80fc9b81e30dde0031e48973.avif?t=1772290875\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras_big/b482834a80fc9b81e30dde0031e48973.webp?t=1772290875 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras/54a763696a2f30d21e68e8ef3ea12c58.avif?t=1772290875\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634950/extras_big/54a763696a2f30d21e68e8ef3ea12c58.avif?t=1772290875 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Feature in This Title: The \u201cPERK\u201d System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-tree system that allows you to unlock various functions using BP earned from winning battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently enhance driver abilities, increase rewards, and improve conven